{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "label": "AggregateSeedProvider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "rationale": "Probiert mehrere Provider der Reihe nach und nimmt das erste nicht-leere Ergebnis; leer ist kein Fehler, triggert aber genauso Fallback wie ein Fehler. Scheitern alle, resolved lookup() zu [] und Cluster.join self-bootstrapt oder retried.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_first_wins_chaining", "label": "First-wins, nicht Union", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "rationale": "Liefert der erste Provider ein Ergebnis, wird der zweite nie konsultiert. Wer die Vereinigung will (K8s-Pods plus DNS-entdeckte VMs im Hybrid-Setup), braucht eine andere Abstraktion \u2014 vor dem Join mergen oder einen eigenen Provider schreiben.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_log_callback", "label": "Optionaler Log-Callback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "rationale": "Zweites Konstruktor-Argument, per Default ein No-op \u2014 Provider-Fehler werden also STILL geschluckt, bis man eine Log-Funktion uebergibt. Erst damit sieht man, welche Provider es versucht haben und woran sie scheiterten.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_ordering_matters", "label": "Reihenfolge und gestapelte Latenz", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "rationale": "Bevorzugten Provider zuerst, Fallback zuletzt \u2014 und die Reihenfolge explizit testen. Laeuft der erste Provider in ein Timeout, wartet man dieses Timeout ab, bevor der zweite dran ist; fuer latenzempfindlichen Boot schnelle Provider nach vorn oder kurze Timeouts setzen.", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_config_configseedprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_dns_dnsseedprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_kubernetes_api_kubernetesapiseedprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_first_wins_chaining", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_ordering_matters", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_first_wins_chaining", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_log_callback", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_discovery_seed_providers_config_seedsfromenv", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}